---
// Anatomy diagram: caller -> wrapper -> real libc with three taps.
---

<section class="section" id="anatomy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
      <h2>One shared library sits between your binary and libc.</h2>
      <p>
        retrace preloads a small (<code class="mono">~200&nbsp;KB</code>) shared library into the target
        process. Every libc call routes through a single assembly trampoline per function. You decide —
        per call, per script — what happens at each of the three taps.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="anatomy glass reveal">
      <div class="anatomy-row">
        <div class="anatomy-node">
          <div class="label">Caller</div>
          <div class="symbol">your binary</div>
        </div>
        <div class="anatomy-arrow">——→</div>
        <div class="anatomy-node wrapper">
          <div class="label">retrace wrapper</div>
          <div class="symbol">trampoline + engine</div>
        </div>
        <div class="anatomy-arrow">——→</div>
        <div class="anatomy-node">
          <div class="label">Real libc</div>
          <div class="symbol">malloc, open, …</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="anatomy-taps">
        <div class="tap see">
          <div class="marker">▸ TAP 1 — SEE</div>
          <div class="copy">
            Inspect arguments before the call. <code>log_params</code> emits args as JSON.
            <code>call_real</code> lets it proceed.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tap control">
          <div class="marker">▸ TAP 2 — CONTROL</div>
          <div class="copy">
            Rewrite the call. <code>modify_in_param_str</code>, <code>modify_in_param_int</code>,
            <code>modify_return_value_int</code>.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tap break">
          <div class="marker">▸ TAP 3 — BREAK</div>
          <div class="copy">
            Make it fail. <code>memory_fuzz</code>, <code>incomplete_io</code>, <code>delay</code>,
            <code>call_count_limit</code>, <code>sandbox</code>.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.section {
  padding: 80px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
}
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .section { padding: 56px 0; }
}

.section-head { margin-bottom: 48px; }
.section-head .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.section-head h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  max-width: 700px;
}
.section-head p {
  margin-top: 16px;
  color: var(--color-dim);
  font-size: 17px;
  max-width: 640px;
}
.section-head code {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--color-text);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  padding: 1px 5px;
  border-radius: 3px;
}

.anatomy {
  padding: 48px 32px;
  position: relative;
}
.anatomy-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.4fr auto 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
}
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .anatomy-row {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .anatomy-arrow { display: none; }
}

.anatomy-node {
  background: rgba(7, 9, 13, 0.55);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  padding: 18px 16px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-align: center;
}
.anatomy-node .label {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--color-dim);
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.anatomy-node .symbol {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text);
}
.anatomy-node.wrapper {
  border-color: rgba(94, 227, 255, 0.25);
  background: rgba(94, 227, 255, 0.04);
}
.anatomy-node.wrapper .label { color: var(--color-see); }

.anatomy-arrow {
  color: var(--color-dim);
  font-size: 14px;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
}

.anatomy-taps {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  margin-top: 40px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .anatomy-taps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

.tap {
  padding: 24px 16px;
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}
.tap:last-child { border-right: none; }
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .tap { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
  .tap:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
}
.tap .marker {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.tap.see .marker { color: var(--color-see); }
.tap.control .marker { color: var(--color-control); }
.tap.break .marker { color: var(--color-break); }
.tap .copy {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--color-dim);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.tap .copy code {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  color: var(--color-text);
  background: rgba(7, 9, 13, 0.5);
  padding: 1px 5px;
  border-radius: 3px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}
</style>
